<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-17T19:38:48.280Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:38:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF has carried out drone strikes on markets in Nyala, killing at least 30 civilians, and attacked a mine in South Kordofan, prompting UN warnings of no serious settlement commitment. The SAF blamed the RSF for a separate market bombing in Darfur, while the Sudanese army reported killing dozens of RSF fighters in Nyala. US officials are urging a humanitarian truce and criticize the US ceasefire proposal as potentially leading to a Libya-style partition. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DdVo0cVRncXRWb0Q0Y3dvM0QxZEtFZGd4eFQwRUQwTllWZDBjZ0FYMkpHdGNKNUw3ZnZkRnoxOFVZUWdFU3N2T0JpOWV4TUpKVE5RVDFRWnlEZ9IBX0FVX3lxTE84YkRGMTBGYkdwNmszTGJnMURCN1pCZTJOWHYyTGFVQ21JbHdyQnVSUE5OMS1ySHJMSTJlYmhnaFFQV2xDcXNiNE9SUndNUDZuRk01TXRQaURHRmVET2pJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNOHFhTUotRHNhR05Uc2kwMVNKczZzLTNtTUlIbXUtZ1hrR1RUdEhtY1pCQmxNbjZ1ZURjTmpyeUQwSDc5V3JVLS11eGZHWUNnYWdsSWphMnVHZ2dCbGpnOHNQR2tJb2pZUkRQSXIzc2UyYWY4TmFkY3RSZmZzNnRVSzRqU3BMV0p2NVhyUzdYRlpReV9HWTdhMnV4eWNyUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE02dmt4TmtkeWNsbFRpdjNuTEJEQUt2N01DZXJ0anppQjhWQ1dSMjBFeFBaZHNzLVRCS2QtdDdWQ040MmZpS2pwRVVPNURGOVpE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQM2V3VUgzV0FfT09CWGxtOG1jMEVZOU95RHMyYXVBUjF2LUZrblltRnhZVkhkWnJTU0IwVGRRSEZJZW5yM2ItRzJtUXZKekdHY1hVbS1JUUh1NXFPdllXZjRkd3d3Qkotb2RnRzlxRlpnOU9KUE1VT1pnRXVTV01FdjNLMmlEeWZBcEgtdVNIOFpfajhjVzBDektXdldNemlGaFlRUWRlbFotY0ZURGhN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr